  "releaseNotes": "Multiple partitions (1-8), zone bypass, keypress and optional panic commands, zone sets, optional require-code-to-arm and a SecurityKeypad partition device. Contact ID events are now described in words (who armed or disarmed, which sensor alarmed) with an event history, per-partition last armed/disarmed by, and an unoEvent location event. Per-partition trouble decoding, zone temperatures, PGM output buttons, tamper reported as tamper (not an open/closed zone), and online/offline status on every device. Exponential reconnect back-off; queued commands never run late, and a busy panel is retried. Disarm codes are no longer written to the hub database. Optional alarm, trouble and arm/disarm notifications. Diagnostic events are now opt-in to cut database writes. Added a debugDump command and a test suite.",
